# Phase X

* Comment parenting
* General image quality? Contrast and sharpen maybe
* Image lightbox / loupe
* Import posts should regularly reset Doctrine
* Create a tree view of post -> image / media like
    2025/09/test-post
    - 2025/09/test.jpg (thumbnails, slideshow etc.)
      - test-123x456.avif
      - test-123x456.webp
      - test-123x456.jpg
      - test-320x320.avif
      - test-320x320.webp
      - test-320x320.jpg
    - 2025/09/video.mp4 (video)
    - 2025/09/only-linked.jpg (link)
* Microformats for anime linking e.g. data-anidb-id="", possibly use <data> tags?
* Square images on the previous / next post block
* Twitter archive
* Set the maps to only load when scrolled into view
* When plotting routes mark start and end, maybe with points in between with the time / altitude

